		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4790&amp;p=35348#p35348"><![CDATA[
Blank screen is usually caused by bad connections in the ribbon cable between the radio main board and the front panel. This is quite a common failure and may have coincidentally occured when you did the firmware update. <br><br>The usual fix for this it to disconnect and reconnect both ends of the ribbon cable. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Fri Jan 24, 2025 9:55 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
